  reduced forms of discriminant -52: [(1, 0, 13), (2, 2, 7)]
  reduced forms of discriminant -148: [(1, 0, 37), (2, 2, 19)]
== C. three grids agree for d = 5, 13, 37 (split primes q below 200000)
